+# Owner integration of the independent methods audit
+
+October 27, 2026. EM01–EM08 are incorporated into this additive layer after source/locator checks. The original ten statements and first-pass review remain preserved at1229c07b; later materials work atce5f2b08 is retained. This does not replace those records or announce a historical verdict reversal.
+
+[REVIEW-v2.json](REVIEW-v2.json) separates each compound assertion's source support, historical assessment and work status. Flight-path reconstruction no longer lends apparent inspected support to unjoined recovery, occupant-identification, photographs or witness claims. Olson's connected-call, zero-duration, Keyton and office-transfer assertions have separate gaps. The later [telephone supplement](https://github.com/AveLyra/911-conspiracy-investigation/blob/639bd09f9f8116707df2be5fb04d87472afd58cb/investigation/broader-evidence/telephone-originals-2026-10-27/README.md) has acquired the mirrored Keyton/Voss forms and decoded the court's stored zero-duration label. Keyton's investigation field is September11 and transcription September14,2001; these are different dates. Canonical provenance, carrier/operator/PBX semantics and unique caller attribution remain open. Preserve159 versus154seconds, eightcalls versus seven displayed rows and the direct/collect disagreement; no cause is selected. The same rule applies to affirmative FAA/steel criticisms and materials claims.
+
+[SOURCE-DEPENDENCE.json](SOURCE-DEPENDENCE.json) maps repeated documents, reported instrument channels and unknown custody/calibration relationships. Three claims reuse UA93; two reuse the CVR transcript. The author's decoder, full/reduced CSVs and paper share an input/producer lineage. Repetition adds no independent experiment, while distinct channels are not dismissed merely because one report combines them.
+
+[COMPARISONS.json](COMPARISONS.json) is the unchanged omitted arithmetic file. [LOCATOR-MAP.json](LOCATOR-MAP.json) supplies six verified NPS derived-to-raw anchors; court locators remain candidates. [DEPENDENCY-JOINS.json](DEPENDENCY-JOINS.json) links actual byte-identical historical FAA and steel reports under dependencies. Their original local/unpublished labels describe creation status, not this later export. The reports retain failed-ASR and survivor/candidate qualifications; no new clock reconstruction, assay or physical test was performed.
+
+Later work matters: the official AA77 report, cited airline printout, decoder source and producer outputs have been acquired. A local output-consistency check ran twice identically; native FDR/agency CSV/clock/custody and physical joins remain open. Do not reopen the report-acquisition gap or call producer-output agreement independent raw decoding. Materials identification figures/selected appendices, conditional oxygen arithmetic and four-trace/three-collection linkage were reviewed after the frozen pass. Native instrument/custody/matched-specimen and chip/run gaps remain. Millette's different-specimen qualification already appeared in the original assessment; the auditor's pointer error did not alter or lose the PDF.
+
+[SOURCE-GAPS.json](SOURCE-GAPS.json) is a generated view of the existing investigation task register's gaps, with stable parent-task IDs, priorities, exact known locators or explicit missing identifiers, access/inspection state, dependencies, next records/tests and observable completion criteria. The two report-export entries describe publication joins separately from underlying scientific/historical work. FAA postreport work stays with its assigned owner. All original sixteen tasks, five supplements, baseline134IDs and conflicting values remain; the purposefully selected ten claims do not estimate an overall error rate or percentage complete.
+
+[AUDIT-DISPOSITION.json](AUDIT-DISPOSITION.json) gives each EM item's disposition. [PROVENANCE.json](PROVENANCE.json) identifies versions and reading limits. [TEXT-CHANGES.diff](TEXT-CHANGES.diff) compares the new annotation layer with the immediately preceding preserved review and records the new report text; source/layout reviews are separate. Missing inputs remain unacquired unless a source separately establishes withholding/loss/destruction. Access failure and logical nonexclusion do not supply affirmative evidence for an alternative.
+
+This is the substantive owner's adoption, not merely the auditor's proposal. Underlying historical tests remain open. Local, branch-published, default-main and accepted states are separate: publication requires a separate dated exact-ref/file receipt. The public packet excludes native attachments, private case/correspondence/history, source-contact fields and the new local CIA interview findings. No merge, force push, outreach, fee, filing or deletion is authorized.

Immediate prepublication draft correction after the completed telephone supplement was located. Earlier draft preserved locally; no published history rewritten.

